    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000pjig](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000pjig) Magnitude 6.2 earthquake at 86.235 depth occurred on Jan 12 2025 88km E of Tecomán. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 18.7264 longitude -103.1004. It impacted 35647 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
